{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月23日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261123.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】發展局建議修訂建築物條例，引入指明僭建物定義，提高罰則，同時改革對樓宇維修工程的規管，具體如何執行？</p><p>周一的《時事全方位》，請來發展局官員探討。</p><p>題目：修訂建築物條例</p><p>熱線電話: 1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:23:47.224772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:51:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T19:17:56.823882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:24.203530+00:00","content_hash":"df495744688814896e99ce4f5466db2d16cbbb5f1942736a37a391377f99ade0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}